        comment     2026-11-18T21:25:49Z
            Bindings: saved, not derived (agent, proposed for the user's read). A binding is the entry's wiring
            overridden by the ref's `context` (code:packages/flow-state-v3/src/host/refs.ts#actorRef,
            code:packages/flow-state-v3/src/host/wiring.ts#overridesBy), which is not part of the identity, and a
            boot-woken Owing identity has no ref (code:packages/flow-state-v3/src/core/incarnations.ts#boot ensures in
