            failure primary; only cleanup failing makes the first cleanup failure primary in phase order; an interrupted
            owned Effect classifies Interruption; the CLI prints a rendered Diagnostic and never a Cause or stack. Then
            build the renderer and route the CLI through it.

            May change: `src/`, `tests/`, @spec.Diagnostics with `specs.log` notes. Evidence: this Task's comments.

